  "history_of_present_illness": "The patient has a long\u2011standing history of essential hypertension (since 1991) and metabolic syndrome with obesity. Diabetes mellitus is inferred from insulin therapy and prediabetes finding. Progressive diabetic kidney disease led to CKD stage 2 in 2005, advancing to stage 3 later that year, stage 4 by 2011, and now the patient is awaiting renal transplantation. Proteinuria, microalbuminuria, and anemia have developed. In 2011 the patient underwent coronary artery bypass grafting for ischemic heart disease and continues on antiplatelet, beta\u2011blocker, nitrate, statin, and calcium\u2011channel blocker therapy. Social isolation and limited social contact are noted, and the last documented clinical encounter was in September 2013.",
